+# Instagram Direct MCP v1
+
+## Purpose
+
+Repository-native carrier for a direct Instagram connector for ChatGPT/QIK-VRT.
+
+## Required architecture
+
+ChatGPT <-> MCP server <-> official Instagram API
+
+No Windsor dependency. No synthetic Facebook account or Facebook Page is to be created merely as an authentication bridge.
+
+## Invariants
+
+1. OAuth/identity consent remains user-controlled.
+2. Credentials and access tokens MUST NOT be committed to this repository.
+3. Bind the exact Instagram account identity before any mutation.
+4. Read operations and mutation operations are separate capabilities.
+5. Every mutation requires explicit authorization at the action boundary.
+6. TRANSPORT_ACK != EFFECT_ACK.
+7. A successful API response is not completion: perform a fresh Instagram readback and compare the intended observable state.
+8. Unsupported Instagram API operations remain UNSUPPORTED/UNKNOWN; do not emulate them by password-based browser automation.
+9. Fail closed on account mismatch, missing scopes, expired tokens, ambiguous media identity, or absent readback.
+10. Implementation/deployment blockers recurse to the next repository-native solution; they are not completion states.
+
+## Initial tool surface
+
+- get_account
+- list_media
+- get_media
+- publish_media (only when officially supported for the bound account)
+- manage_media (only operations explicitly exposed by the official API)
+- verify_effect
+
+## Acceptance
+
+DONE iff:
+
+    implementation_materialized
+    AND deployable_service
+    AND OAuth callback reachable
+    AND exact_account_bound
+    AND requested operation supported
+    AND execution acknowledged
+    AND fresh readback matches intended observable state
+
+Until all applicable terms hold:
+
+    EFFECT_ACK_DONE = FALSE
